@title Single-line diagram: lamps and sounders on a one-phase feeder
@area Reports
# A one-pole breaker feeds two lamps and a sounder at the phase voltage; a 24 V lamp stays off the diagram and is named in the notes.
open qa/fixtures/distribution-board-lighting.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text single line
wait 4
key Enter
wait 20
shot single-line-lighting
check_blank single-line-lighting
check_layout
click_text Schedule #1
wait 10
shot single-line-lighting-schedule
check_layout
